Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.42,0:09:54.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.97,0:03:09.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别害怕  亨利少爷\N{\rEng}Fear not, young master Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.92,0:03:11.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会勇敢的\N{\rEng}You will be brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.58,0:03:16.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你本就勇敢\N{\rEng}Because you are brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.96,0:03:40.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们面临严峻的机遇和挑战\N{\rEng}We face dire challenge and chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.85,0:03:43.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的性命\N{\rEng}Our lives...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.96,0:03:46.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生活方式\N{\rEng}our way of life...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.36,0:03:50.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危在旦夕\N{\rEng}it hangs in the balance,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.15,0:03:53.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犹如一块易碎的玻璃立在电线上\N{\rEng}a fragile glass standing on a wire,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.02,0:03:55.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,位于柏油马路上方\N{\rEng}high above the asphalt,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.54,0:04:00.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我们祈祷着阴天不会落雨一滴\N{\rEng}as we pray for not one drop of rain under an overcast sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.14,0:04:06.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我依然在笑\N{\rEng}And yet, I smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.59,0:04:12.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会战斗  我们会流血\N{\rEng}We will fight, and we will bleed...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.52,0:04:14.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我依然在笑\N{\rEng}and yet I smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.01,0:04:18.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要面对敌人\N{\rEng}We shall face men,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.69,0:04:22.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一些因形势所迫而助纣为虐\N{\rEng}some cornered into their roles by circumstance,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.42,0:04:25.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另一些是嗜血成性的亡命凶徒\N{\rEng}some desperate murderers thrilled by blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.06,0:04:27.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要终结他们\N{\rEng}We shall end them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.72,0:04:30.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亦如终结今日的进攻\N{\rEng}As is our charge this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.62,0:04:33.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亦如终结我们的痛苦\N{\rEng}As is our sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.99,0:04:38.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我依然在笑\N{\rEng}And yet, I smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.98,0:04:43.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们将离开至亲\N{\rEng}We will leave our loved ones...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.88,0:04:46.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿过危险重重的道路\N{\rEng}to traverse a dangerous road.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.54,0:04:52.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,远离和平  踏入战场\N{\rEng}Rushing out of peace into war.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.55,0:04:57.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我依然在笑\N{\rEng}And yet, I smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.99,0:05:03.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们会从今日的战斗中找到荣耀\N{\rEng}For we will mine glory from the rock of struggle this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.01,0:05:08.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们将会尊重和保护这座死人之地中的\N{\rEng}We will honor and protect this -- this bastion of life
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.16,0:05:11.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,活人堡垒  我们必将胜利\N{\rEng}in a land of the dead, and we will win.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.82,0:05:15.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要信任国王  我们必将胜利\N{\rEng}You trust the king -- we will win.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.36,0:05:18.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我微笑\N{\rEng}I smile...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.74,0:05:20.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大笑\N{\rEng}I laugh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.21,0:05:24.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我万分欣喜\N{\rEng}I rejoice this day...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.53,0:05:26.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为在今天\N{\rEng}for on this day,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.91,0:05:29.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们梦想相通\N{\rEng}we are joined in purpose and vision
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.36,0:05:33.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们心神合一\N{\rEng}we are of a singular heart and mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.43,0:05:35.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天  我们团结一致\N{\rEng}On this day, we are one!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.94,0:05:36.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEng}Yeah! ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.57,0:05:39.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-对  -没错\N{\rEng}- Yes. - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.52,0:05:41.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,团结一致\N{\rEng}We are one!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.91,0:05:42.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\rEng}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.48,0:05:43.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,团结一致\N{\rEng}We are one!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.58,0:05:44.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\rEng}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.95,0:05:47.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,团结一致\N{\rEng}We are one!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.58,0:05:51.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,团结一致\N{\rEng}We are one!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.43,0:05:53.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,团结一致\N{\rEng}We are one!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.09,0:11:20.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陛下\N{\rEng}Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.42,0:11:21.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,数量太多了\N{\rEng}There are too many!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.84,0:11:22.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走\N{\rEng}Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.22,0:11:28.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能走路吗  陛下\N{\rEng}Can you walk, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.86,0:11:30.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须用手杖撑着\N{\rEng}With my cane. I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.70,0:11:31.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我扶你\N{\rEng}I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.69,0:11:32.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我扶你\N{\rEng}I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.26,0:11:36.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能为我冒险\N{\rEng}You cannot endanger yourself for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.80,0:11:38.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陛下  我必须这样做\N{\rEng}Your Majesty... I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.61,0:12:40.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蠢货  拿上枪\N{\rEng}Asshats, get those guns,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.19,0:12:42.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们赶紧走\N{\rEng}and let's screw the hell off now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.84,0:12:44.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要帮助\N{\rEng}We need some help here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.07,0:12:47.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们需要的是他妈加速\N{\rEng}What you need is to hurry your asses up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.59,0:12:48.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要是不在我走过转角之前\N{\rEng}If you're not out of here with those guns
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.85,0:12:50.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把枪搬出来\N{\rEng}by the time I round this corner,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.51,0:12:52.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就揍扁你们\N{\rEng}I am gonna flay your asses!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.15,0:12:53.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说到做到\N{\rEng}It is real now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.45,0:12:55.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快好了  老天啊\N{\rEng}We're almost done! Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.40,0:13:09.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-没搞错吧  -怎么\N{\rEng}- What the hell? - ?What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.78,0:13:11.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩这几箱0.50子弹了吗\N{\rEng}Those are the only .50-cal buckets we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.85,0:13:12.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剩下的在库里\N{\rEng}Got the rest in the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.92,0:13:14.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些只是用来打他们的\N{\rEng}This was just to tear 'em up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.50,0:13:15.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们至少还有...\N{\rEng}We got at least --
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.22,0:14:00.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让她走\N{\rEng}Let her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.66,0:14:02.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿上枪\N{\rEng}Grab the guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.72,0:14:08.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总部肯定出大事了\N{\rEng}Shit has to be goin' down at HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.60,0:14:10.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得赶紧把枪运过去\N{\rEng}We gotta get this shit there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.44,0:14:11.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走\N{\rEng}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.41,0:14:22.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有看见希瓦吗\N{\rEng}Have you seen Shiva?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.28,0:14:24.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们被袭击后就没见了\N{\rEng}Not since we were hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.26,0:14:36.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能穿过...\N{\rEng}We can get through them --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.14,0:14:43.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,举起手\N{\rEng}Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.61,0:14:52.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\rEng}Let's move...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.35,0:14:53.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"国王陛下"\N{\rEng}"Your Highness."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.93,0:15:20.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忘了你的剑了\N{\rEng}Forgot about your blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.67,0:15:22.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我\N{\rEng}Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.63,0:15:25.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得靠它走路\N{\rEng}It's how I can walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.35,0:15:28.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以留着拐杖\N{\rEng}You can keep the cane.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.64,0:15:41.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你帮忙\N{\rEng}I'm gonna need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.11,0:15:44.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有好长的路要走\N{\rEng}We got a big trip ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.09,0:15:46.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-去哪儿  -你猜\N{\rEng}- Where? - ?Guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.12,0:15:50.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救世堂\N{\rEng}The Sanctuary?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.98,0:15:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,答对了\N{\rEng}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.62,0:15:55.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大门已经关上了\N{\rEng}The gates are down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.03,0:15:57.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四周被行尸包围\N{\rEng}It's surrounded by the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.54,0:16:00.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们出不来  我们也进不去\N{\rEng}They can't get out. We can't get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.73,0:16:03.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许你能帮我\N{\rEng}Well, maybe you can help me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.31,0:16:05.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把机枪送过去\N{\rEng}get our big guns over there
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.36,0:16:07.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮助挽回局势\N{\rEng}to help remedy that situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.16,0:16:33.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弹药在车里吗\N{\rEng}Ammo's in the truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.20,0:16:37.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救世堂至少还有三箱\N{\rEng}There's another three up at Sanctuary and then some.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.68,0:16:59.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  给我走\N{\rEng}Hurry up. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.86,0:17:09.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你走了这么远\N{\rEng}You made it this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.27,0:17:10.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做了那么多破事\N{\rEng}After pulling all the crap you did,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.55,0:17:12.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在却要倒下吗\N{\rEng}you're gonna lie down now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.10,0:17:14.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我宁愿死\N{\rEng}Better the dead be my end
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.79,0:17:17.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不愿当一个暴君的无名小卒\N{\rEng}than a despot's meaningless foot soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.83,0:17:18.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\rEng}Tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.57,0:17:21.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼根知道你叫什么吗\N{\rEng}does Negan know your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.35,0:17:25.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是尼根\N{\rEng}I'm Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.92,0:17:27.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站起来\N{\rEng}Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.73,0:17:30.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会让你利用我伤害我的子民\N{\rEng}I will not let you use me to hurt my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.73,0:17:32.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的子民\N{\rEng}"Your people"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.53,0:17:33.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说那些被你哄骗\N{\rEng}You mean all those sheep you rooked
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.95,0:17:35.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以为你是王的奴才吗\N{\rEng}into thinking you're a king?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.30,0:17:39.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听说过你的事\N{\rEng}Yeah, I heard your story.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.15,0:17:40.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都听说过\N{\rEng}We all did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.95,0:17:45.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走  快点\N{\rEng}Let's go. Now. Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.04,0:17:54.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在马戏团工作吗\N{\rEng}You work at a circus?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.32,0:17:57.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不在\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.94,0:18:00.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾觉得有可能  但想想不对\N{\rEng}Yeah, I thought maybe, but nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.02,0:18:03.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马戏团可不会善待动物\N{\rEng}They don't treat animals too nice at the circus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.05,0:18:05.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而那只猫特别钟爱你\N{\rEng}And that cat just loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.61,0:18:08.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它给了你一切  不是吗\N{\rEng}It gave you everything, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.68,0:18:11.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给了你手段  让你编故事\N{\rEng}Gave you an angle, a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.73,0:18:14.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不得不佩服你\N{\rEng}Got to hand it to you --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.09,0:18:15.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真有一套\N{\rEng}you played your cards good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.69,0:18:17.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把子民耍得团团转\N{\rEng}You played "Your people" Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.20,0:18:21.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们深信你的鬼话\N{\rEng}They ate that horseshit right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.46,0:18:25.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为你种庄稼\N{\rEng}They grew food for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.17,0:18:27.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为你建高墙\N{\rEng}Built those walls for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.44,0:18:28.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见鬼  瞧瞧\N{\rEng}Hell, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.68,0:18:32.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你害死了他们  他们依然追随着你\N{\rEng}You got them all killed -- they're still following you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.33,0:18:35.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但没了那只老虎\N{\rEng}But take away that tiger...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.36,0:18:36.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还算什么\N{\rEng}what's left?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.40,0:18:41.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过是某个穿着戏服的骗子\N{\rEng}Just some meaningless con man in a costume.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.81,0:20:05.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面还有你的人活着吗\N{\rEng}You got people still alive in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.81,0:20:08.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但愿如此\N{\rEng}Let it be so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.49,0:20:12.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们找辆车坐  然后离开这里\N{\rEng}We're getting into something with wheels, and we're getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.60,0:20:23.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结束了  好吗\N{\rEng}It's over, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.26,0:20:25.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你试过了  结束了\N{\rEng}You took your shot -- it's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.39,0:21:03.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妄想狂\N{\rEng}Delusions of grandeur.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.80,0:21:07.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起来\N{\rEng}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.03,0:21:29.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\rEng}Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.66,0:21:34.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行尸快过来了\N{\rEng}The dead are nearly upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.02,0:21:36.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把剑给我\N{\rEng}Give me my sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.12,0:21:38.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以一起抵御它们\N{\rEng}We can fight 'em together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.89,0:21:39.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在做什么\N{\rEng}The hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.99,0:21:41.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离开这里\N{\rEng}Gettin' out of here. ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.24,0:21:45.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一个人站不稳\N{\rEng}I can't stand on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.62,0:21:47.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爬不过去\N{\rEng}I can't climb that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.85,0:21:49.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不用爬过去\N{\rEng}You don't need to. ?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.68,0:22:04.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样吧\N{\rEng}Is what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.79,0:22:06.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼根本希望我把你\N{\rEng}Negan was hoping to have your ass
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.32,0:22:08.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拴在救世堂的栅栏上\N{\rEng}chained to the Sanctuary fence...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.01,0:22:11.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你  寡妇\N{\rEng}You, the Widow...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.11,0:22:13.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\rEng}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.92,0:22:19.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但把你的首级串在矛上也行\N{\rEng}But your head on a pike will do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.37,0:22:22.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许可以弄乱点\N{\rEng}Maybe break it up a little,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.34,0:22:27.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用那么对称\N{\rEng}avoid the obvious symmetry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.15,0:22:48.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord1}4号门
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.14,0:23:18.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以告诉你们其他人在哪\N{\rEng}I can tell you where the others are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.91,0:23:21.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别杀我\N{\rEng}Just let me live!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.15,0:23:23.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们躲起来了\N{\rEng}They're hiding out,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.12,0:23:25.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等其他救世军出现\N{\rEng}waiting for other Saviors to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.19,0:23:29.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢出来\N{\rEng}Nice and slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.00,0:23:39.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没武器\N{\rEng}I'm unarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.77,0:23:42.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看\N{\rEng}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.50,0:23:48.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陛下  你的腿\N{\rEng}Your Majesty, your leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.48,0:23:51.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\rEng}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.74,0:23:59.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰瑞\N{\rEng}Jerry...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.52,0:24:04.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我借用一下\N{\rEng}I'm going to borrow this for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.49,0:24:05.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰瑞  我能...\N{\rEng}Jerry, I can --
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.42,0:24:15.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陛下\N{\rEng}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.67,0:24:21.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不需要那样称呼我\N{\rEng}You don't need to call me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.15,0:24:23.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老兄\N{\rEng}Dude...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.60,0:24:24.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要\N{\rEng}yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.55,0:24:36.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的人\N{\rEng}Your people...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.20,0:24:43.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在哪\N{\rEng}...where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.16,0:24:52.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能告诉他们是我说的\N{\rEng}You can't tell them I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.80,0:24:55.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须答应我  求求你\N{\rEng}You have to promise. Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.16,0:24:56.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想死吗\N{\rEng}Hey, do you wanna die?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.47,0:24:58.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我问你的人在哪\N{\rEng}I asked you where your people are --
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.69,0:25:02.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都把枪放下\N{\rEng}Lower your guns now!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.61,0:25:10.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雅戈  求你了\N{\rEng}Yago, please, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.42,0:25:14.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔伊自己搞砸了  开火\N{\rEng}Joey just pooched it. Light 'em up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.90,0:25:16.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord1}4号门
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.91,0:25:45.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\rEng}Shitballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.28,0:25:51.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待在我身后  陛下\N{\rEng}Get behind me, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.71,0:25:55.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.42,0:26:36.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你  陛下\N{\rEng}Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.50,0:26:38.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\rEng}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.45,0:26:41.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你是一个超酷的兄弟\N{\rEng}For being such a cool dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.87,0:27:04.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要结束这一切\N{\rEng}We need to end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.07,0:27:08.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于你朋友  你骗了我们对吗\N{\rEng}You were lying to us about your friends, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.77,0:27:11.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  我骗了你们\N{\rEng}Yeah. I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.31,0:27:14.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在  我们需要结束这一切\N{\rEng}Now, we need to end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.05,0:27:16.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行  走开吧  女士\N{\rEng}Okay. Walk away, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.85,0:27:20.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不能把枪带走\N{\rEng}You're not going anywhere with those guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.33,0:27:21.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我们要带走\N{\rEng}Nah. We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.48,0:27:23.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们要被送去某个地方\N{\rEng}They got someplace to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.97,0:27:27.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拿到了你们朋友的弹药\N{\rEng}I've got your pal's ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.43,0:27:31.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打完那些行尸  你们还剩多少子弹\N{\rEng}How many bullets you got left after all those walkers?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.15,0:27:32.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三颗  四颗\N{\rEng}Three? Four?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.74,0:27:34.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你何不过来亲眼看看\N{\rEng}Why don't you come at us and find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.21,0:27:35.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就在这\N{\rEng}We're right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.13,0:27:54.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝贝  继续说\N{\rEng}Honey, let's keep talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.58,0:27:56.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们最不缺的就是时间\N{\rEng}We got all the time in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.33,0:28:07.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以前战斗过吗\N{\rEng}Have you ever fought before?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.12,0:28:11.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你见过我战斗\N{\rEng}You've seen me fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.35,0:28:12.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说之前\N{\rEng}Before this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.65,0:28:15.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行尸\N{\rEng}The dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.52,0:28:18.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还在树林里遇到过一次强盗\N{\rEng}A marauder in the woods once.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.46,0:28:20.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你和他战斗了吗  -是的\N{\rEng}- You fought him? - ?Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.81,0:28:21.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先上\N{\rEng}Me...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.34,0:28:23.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后希瓦上\N{\rEng}then Shiva.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.68,0:28:29.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我受过很长时间的训练\N{\rEng}I have trained for a very long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.02,0:28:31.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也没有中断训练\N{\rEng}And I have continued,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.68,0:28:33.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从很久之前直到现在\N{\rEng}from long before this till now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.14,0:28:36.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我每天都在不断练习\N{\rEng}And I have practiced for days on end.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.10,0:28:39.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好了成为我必须成为的人\N{\rEng}I am ready to become what I must.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.31,0:28:42.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"成为"吗\N{\rEng}"To become"?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.44,0:28:46.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\rEng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.95,0:28:50.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让自己变成必须变成的样子\N{\rEng}To will myself into what I must be.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.11,0:28:53.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以前是动物园管理员\N{\rEng}I was a zookeeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.45,0:28:58.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我原来...很温和\N{\rEng}I was...meek.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.13,0:29:03.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周末的日场  无数个夜晚\N{\rEng}Those weekend matinees, those nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.25,0:29:06.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一次  工作期间\N{\rEng}And then, at work,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.16,0:29:09.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一头五百磅重的老虎需要救助\N{\rEng}a 500-pound tiger needed my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.46,0:29:12.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它一直在流血...\N{\rEng}And as she bled...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.88,0:29:16.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有立即跳进它的围场\N{\rEng}I did not just leap into her enclosure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.59,0:29:20.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也没有被深层本能\N{\rEng}I was not seized by any...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.09,0:29:22.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吓得不知所措\N{\rEng}deep-seated instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.79,0:29:26.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时仅仅\N{\rEng}They were only...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.86,0:29:30.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过了几秒\N{\rEng}a few seconds that passed...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.72,0:29:32.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我已在心中盘算过\N{\rEng}but I deliberated.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.53,0:29:35.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想过要去救它\N{\rEng}I thought about doing it,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.82,0:29:38.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,权衡了接近这样一头猛兽的风险\N{\rEng}weighing the risk of approaching such a beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.90,0:29:42.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想过不去救它\N{\rEng}And I thought about not doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.14,0:29:48.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我站在原地  不断思索我该成为谁\N{\rEng}I stood there, considering who I'd be in either iteration.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.62,0:29:52.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后我决定成为那个跳进去的人\N{\rEng}And I decided I wanted to be the one who leapt.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.13,0:29:58.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多年后\N{\rEng}So, many years later...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.19,0:30:03.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本杰明告诉了我  我早已知道\N{\rEng}Benjamin was the one who told me what I already knew,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.16,0:30:04.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却看不清的事实\N{\rEng}but couldn't hear...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.27,0:30:10.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"如果需要你当英雄"\N{\rEng}"If you're asked to be the hero...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.09,0:30:12.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"就去当英雄"\N{\rEng}be the hero."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.44,0:30:15.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在准备好了\N{\rEng}I'm now ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.64,0:30:17.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于准备好了\N{\rEng}Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.33,0:30:20.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想通了\N{\rEng}I've deliberated.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.24,0:30:23.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经决定好要成为怎样的人\N{\rEng}I've made the decision on who I will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.35,0:30:27.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的转变简单吗\N{\rEng}Was it easier for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.36,0:30:31.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是一直都是这样吗\N{\rEng}Or have you always been this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.20,0:30:33.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么坚强\N{\rEng}This strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.24,0:30:35.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么勇敢\N{\rEng}This brave?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.52,0:30:39.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是说你决定成为现在的你\N{\rEng}Or did you decide to be who you are today?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.05,0:30:44.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我决定的\N{\rEng}I decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.43,0:30:46.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和你一样\N{\rEng}Just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.80,0:30:51.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但命运也会决定一些事\N{\rEng}But life ?decided some things, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.26,0:30:57.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实决定过\N{\rEng}It does.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.74,0:31:00.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以后也会决定\N{\rEng}It will.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.95,0:31:36.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\rEng}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.24,0:31:38.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们拿走枪了吗\N{\rEng}Did they get the guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.02,0:31:40.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们无能为力\N{\rEng}Nothing we can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.89,0:31:53.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我扶国王\N{\rEng}I've got the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.85,0:32:03.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须通知瑞克\N{\rEng}We have to get word to Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.90,0:32:06.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他们把机枪运到救世堂...\N{\rEng}If they ferry those machine guns to the Sanctuary...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.11,0:32:14.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不会运到救世堂的\N{\rEng}They're not getting them to the Sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.65,0:35:24.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们拿到枪了\N{\rEng}We got the guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.22,0:35:27.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看起来真狼狈\N{\rEng}You look like shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.46,0:35:35.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去看看那混蛋是否活着\N{\rEng}Let's go see if this asshole's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.11,0:35:57.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陛下\N{\rEng}Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.25,0:35:59.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行不通的\N{\rEng}This ain't gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.43,0:36:02.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们必须留下我  我拖后腿了\N{\rEng}You gotta leave me. I'm slowing you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.59,0:36:04.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  你不能这样\N{\rEng}No. You don't get to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.76,0:36:08.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来  我要没子弹了\N{\rEng}Come on. I'm almost out of ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.19,0:36:29.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord1}强腐蚀性
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.55,0:36:47.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我过不去\N{\rEng}I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.90,0:36:48.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别管我了\N{\rEng}You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.72,0:36:50.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们快走吧\N{\rEng}Y-You two have to just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.75,0:36:54.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扶他下来\N{\rEng}Lower him down to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.94,0:37:26.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以西结\N{\rEng}Ezekiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.12,0:37:29.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走  我拖住它们\N{\rEng}Just go! I'll hold them off!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.50,0:37:30.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以西结  我们能带走你\N{\rEng}Ezekiel, we can get you away.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.31,0:37:32.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不能\N{\rEng}You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.01,0:37:34.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能离开你  陛下  \N{\rEng}I can't leave you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.31,0:37:37.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托  快走啊\N{\rEng}C'mon, man, just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.51,0:37:38.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是我的国王\N{\rEng}You're my king!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.43,0:37:39.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是\N{\rEng}No, I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.41,0:37:41.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是你的国王\N{\rEng}I'm not your King!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.44,0:37:44.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是你的陛下\N{\rEng}I'm not "Your Majesty"!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.10,0:37:48.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看眼前的这些东西\N{\rEng}Look at what's in front of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.98,0:37:51.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们才是真实的\N{\rEng}That's what's real!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.99,0:37:54.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走\N{\rEng}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.43,0:37:55.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走\N{\rEng}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.86,0:37:58.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是国王\N{\rEng}I ain't no king!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.76,0:38:01.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么都不是\N{\rEng}I ain't nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.66,0:38:03.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是个普通人\N{\rEng}I'm just some guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.52,0:38:05.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碰巧发现了...\N{\rEng}Some guy who found...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.61,0:38:09.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希瓦而已\N{\rEng}Shiva...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.60,0:38:14.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走\N{\rEng}C'mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.84,0:38:25.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希瓦\N{\rEng}Shiva!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.87,0:38:28.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希瓦\N{\rEng}Shiva!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.19,0:38:29.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快跑  姑娘\N{\rEng}Run, girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.68,0:38:32.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不\N{\rEng}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.61,0:38:41.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我  杰瑞\N{\rEng}Please, Jerry!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.70,0:38:44.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死的  我要去帮她\N{\rEng}Dammit, let me help her!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.75,0:38:48.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你帮不了\N{\rEng}You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.74,0:39:12.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord1}危险物质
